{"id":"cervelle","lemma":"cervelle","pos":"noun","rank":2842,"glosses":["brains"],"ipa":"/sɛʁ.vɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Fr-cervelle.ogg/Fr-cervelle.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cervelles"},"formAudio":{"cervelles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-cervelles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'espère que vous avez assez de cervelle pour voir la différence.","en":"I hope you have brains enough to see the difference.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"espérer"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"difference"}]},{"text":"Tom s'est fait sauter la cervelle.","en":"Tom blew his brains out.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to jump, leap"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Il n'a pas assez de cervelle pour faire des additions de tête.","en":"He's not smart enough to add numbers in his head.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"addition","l":"addition"},null,null],"phrases":[[11,13,"in one's head"]]}]}